@Entity
public class Member {

    private static final int MAX_FAILED = 5;
    private static final Duration LOCK_DURATION = Duration.ofMinutes(30);

    public void recordFailure(LocalDateTime now) {
        this.failedCount++;
        if (this.failedCount >= MAX_FAILED) {
            this.locked = true;
            this.lockedAt = now;
        }
    }

    public void recordLogin(LocalDateTime now, String ip) {
        this.failedCount = 0;
        this.lastLoginAt = now;
        this.lastLoginIp = ip;
    }

    public boolean unlockIfExpired(LocalDateTime now) {
        if (!locked || lockedAt == null) return false;
        if (lockedAt.plus(LOCK_DURATION).isAfter(now)) return false;
        this.locked = false;
        this.lockedAt = null;
        this.failedCount = 0;
        return true;
    }
}
```

> **규칙이 리스너가 아니라 엔티티에** 있다.
> **테스트가 HTTP 없이** 된다.
> **8.5절에서 매니저를 만든 이유와** 같다.

**리스너는 얇다.**

